# Stage fill body (no top-pin + void)

In `reading-flow--viewport` trainers, short tasks (bank + gaps, tech cards, speak grid) must **use the space between tabs and footer** — not sit in a strip at the top with 60%+ empty background below.

## Architecture

```
panel (flex:1 column, overflow:hidden)
  ├── chrome (instr, bank, hint) — flex-shrink:0
  └── stage body (flex:1) — grows + centers rows
```

## Required CSS on stage body

```css
.task-list-or-grid {
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  align-self: stretch;
  justify-content: safe center;   /* flex column lists */
  align-content: safe center;     /* grids */
  overflow-y: auto;               /* only this pane scrolls if too tall */
}
```

Prefer class `flow-stage__body` on the growing child, or extend the global selectors in `index.css` (`.vocab-m3__panel--fill .vocab-m3__list`, `speak-m3a__tech--compact`, etc.).

## Hard ban

```css
/* BAD — pins rows to top, void below */
.stage-list { flex: 0 0 auto; align-content: start; overflow: visible; }

/* BAD — duplicate rule later in file overrides flex:1 */
.panel--fill .list { flex: 1 1 auto; }
.panel--fill .list { flex: 0 0 auto; }  /* ← never */
```

Never add a second block for the same selector that resets `flex: 0` or `align-content: start` on a stage body.

## Panel modifiers

| Modifier | Stage body |
|----------|------------|
| `--fill` | `.vocab-m3__list`, `> .read-m3__para-slots`, `> .read-m3__qs`, `> .listen-m3b__grid` |
| `--passage` | `.vocab-m3__passage--fit` (`flex:1`, passage grows) |
| `--tech` | `.speak-m3a__tech--compact` (cards stretch to row height) |
| `--speak` | `.speak-m3a__speak-grid` |
| Language M3a/b | `.lang-m3a__real-list`, `.lang-m3a__type-slots`, `.lang-m3a__mcq`, `.lang-m3b__meaning-grid`, `.lang-m3b__gap-list` |
| `--rewrite` | `.lang-m3a__rewrite`, `.lang-m2a__rewrite` (2×2 grid, rows stretch) |

Panel itself: `overflow: hidden`. **One** inner scroller only when content truly exceeds height.

## Chip buttons on dark panels

Never force `background: #fff` on `.pr-chip` inside lang/vocab/speak trainers — use brass/dark pills (`rgba(255,255,255,0.1)` + gold picked state).

## Before shipping any trainer step

1. Mental check at ~1280×800: is there empty space **below** the task that the list/grid could occupy?
2. If yes → stage body must have `flex: 1`, not `flex: 0`.
3. Grep the selector — no duplicate override later in `index.css`.

Related: `compact-flow-panels.mdc`, `fit-viewport-content.mdc`, `no-useless-scroll.mdc`.
